  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Denmark&#x2019;s core contributions to UNHCR 2022-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of Denmark&#x2019;s support for UNHCR is to address needs in forced displacement contexts and thereby contributing to the achievement of Agenda 2030&#x2019;s commitment to &#x201c;leave no one behind&#x201d; and in particular Sustainable Development Goals (SDG) 1, 5, 10 and 161, as well as the main priorities of Denmark&#x2019;s strategy for development cooperation, The World We Share, relating to poverty, fragility, conflict and creating viable alternatives to forced displacement and irregular migration. It also supports Danish government&#x2019;s ambition for a fair and humane asylum system within international law by focusing in protection and self-reliance for refugees thus helping refugees in humanitarian settings and areas bordering conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
